### Test de l'API Prosoc avec Authentification Améliorée
### Inspiré de Kenergie API Documentation

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7116
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Test Endpoint Public (vérifie que l'API fonctionne)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authtest/public
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 2. Login avec Email (nouveau format multi-canal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOuTelephone": "superadmin@prosoc.cd",
  "motDePasse": "Super-Admin",
  "fcmToken": "test_fcm_token_123",
  "deviceType": "Web",
  "deviceModel": "Chrome Browser",
  "osVersion": "Windows 10",
  "deviceInfo": "Test Device - Chrome on Windows"
}

###

### 3. Login avec Nom d'utilisateur (ancien format compatible)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOuTelephone": "superadmin",
  "motDePasse": "Super-Admin",
  "fcmToken": "test_fcm_token_456",
  "deviceType": "Mobile",
  "deviceModel": "iPhone 14",
  "osVersion": "iOS 16.0",
  "deviceInfo": "Test Device - iPhone 14"
}

###

### 4. Login avec Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOuTelephone": "admin@prosoc.cd",
  "motDePasse": "Admin",
  "fcmToken": "admin_fcm_token",
  "deviceType": "Web",
  "deviceModel": "Firefox",
  "osVersion": "macOS Sonoma",
  "deviceInfo": "Admin Device - Firefox on macOS"
}

###

### 5. Test Endpoint Protégé avec JWT Token
# Remplacer {{accessToken}} par le token obtenu du login
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authtest/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 6. Test Endpoint Admin Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authtest/admin-only
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 7. Test Endpoint Super Admin Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authtest/super-admin-only
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 8. Test Token Info (affiche les claims JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authtest/token-info
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 9. Refresh Token
# Remplacer {{refreshToken}} par le refresh token obtenu du login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}",
  "deviceInfo": "Refreshed Device - Updated Info"
}

###

### 10. Logout (révoque tous les tokens)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 11. Test Endpoint Permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authtest/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 12. Test avec ancien endpoint AuthController (compatibilité)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nomUtilisateur": "superadmin",
  "motDePasse": "Super-Admin",
  "fcmToken": "old_format_fcm",
  "deviceType": "Web",
  "deviceModel": "Safari",
  "osVersion": "macOS"
}

###

### 13. Test login échoué (mauvais mot de passe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOuTelephone": "superadmin@prosoc.cd",
  "motDePasse": "WrongPassword",
  "fcmToken": "test_token"
}

###

### 14. Test login échoué (utilisateur inexistant)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOuTelephone": "nonexistent@prosoc.cd",
  "motDePasse": "SomePassword",
  "fcmToken": "test_token"
}

###

### 15. Test refresh token invalide
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "invalid_refresh_token_12345",
  "deviceInfo": "Invalid Test"
}

###

### 16. Test endpoint protégé sans token (devrait échouer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authtest/protected
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 17. Test endpoint admin-only avec token utilisateur normal (devrait échouer)
# Utiliser le token d'un utilisateur qui n'est pas admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/authtest/admin-only
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 18. Test avec numéro de téléphone (format futur)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOuTelephone": "+243812345678",
  "motDePasse": "Super-Admin",
  "fcmToken": "phone_test_token",
  "deviceType": "Mobile",
  "deviceModel": "Android Phone",
  "osVersion": "Android 13",
  "deviceInfo": "Phone Login Test"
}

###

### 19. Test format email invalide
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "emailOuTelephone": "invalid-email-format",
  "motDePasse": "Super-Admin",
  "fcmToken": "test_token"
}

###

### 20. Test refresh token expiré (simulé)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enhancedauth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "expired_token_simulation",
  "deviceInfo": "Expired Token Test"
}
